        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        {
          "category": "general",
          "text": "iperf3 3.21 (esnet/iperf) contains a remote, unauthenticated heap use-after-free: the server's per-test watchdog server_timer_proc() frees streams without cancelling/joining their worker threads, so a blocked worker dereferences a freed iperf_stream; fixed in 3.22.",
          "title": "CVE description"
        }
      ],
